1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,270
For most foreign teenagers, learning Chinese poems could be boring.
对大多数外国青少年来说，学习中国诗歌可能很枯燥。

2
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:10,000
But for a group of exchange students in China, it became an amazing trip.
但对于一群在中国的交换生来说，这成了一段奇妙的旅程。

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:16,460
To help them learn more, Chinese students in a middle school started a club called “Poetry Gathering”.
为了帮助他们学到更多，一所中学的中国学生成立了一个名为“诗会”的社团。

4
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:22,170
In this club, students explored the classic poems in active and creative ways.
在这个社团里，学生们以积极主动、富有创意的方式探索了这些经典诗歌。

5
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:24,980
Chinese students prepared “fun cards”.
中国学生准备了“趣味卡片”。

6
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:28,480
On the cards were famous poems and theme paintings.
卡片上有著名的诗歌和主题画。

7
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:34,340
Cards about Li Bai’s moon, Du Fu’s mountains, and Wang Wei’s desert were popular.
以李白笔下的月亮、杜甫笔下的山和王维笔下的大漠为主题的卡片很受欢迎。

8
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:39,920
They helped the exchange students know how ancient poets used Chinese to “paint” pictures.
这些卡片帮助交换生了解古代诗人是如何用汉语“画”出画面的。

9
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:46,270
Besides, students used simple instruments like drums to experience the rhythm of the poems.
此外，学生们还用鼓之类的简单乐器来感受诗歌的节奏。

10
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:53,140
“When I play the drums to a Tang poem, I can hear the music hidden in the lines,” said Alice, an exchange student.
“我伴着一首唐诗打鼓时，能听到藏在诗句里的音乐。”交换生爱丽丝说。

11
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:57,410
“It makes the poem easy to sing out loud and interesting to share.”
“这让诗很容易大声唱出来，分享起来也很有趣。”

12
00:00:58,210 --> 00:01:05,360
By putting poems, paintings and the rhythm together, students made the club a fun place where ancient poets met their teenage fans.
通过把诗歌、绘画和节奏结合在一起，学生们让这个社团成了一个有趣的地方，古代诗人在这里遇见了自己的青少年粉丝。

13
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:11,160
When Chinese students and exchange students studied together, they both benefited greatly.
中国学生和交换生一起学习时，双方都受益匪浅。

14
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:16,240
“To help them better understand our poems, I have to do some closer reading.
“为了帮助他们更好地理解我们的诗歌，我必须读得更仔细些。

15
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:19,030
Each character means a lot in poems.
在诗歌里，每个字都有丰富的含义。

16
00:01:19,830 --> 00:01:24,810
For example, 水 (shui) shows beauty, sweetness, and a smooth feeling,” said Li Ran.
比如，‘水’字展现出美感、甘甜和柔滑的感觉。”李然说。

17
00:01:25,610 --> 00:01:31,780
“When my new foreign friend said he could feel the imagery of the lines, I felt very proud of our culture,” Li added.
“我新交的外国朋友说他能感受到这些诗句的意境时，我为我们的文化感到非常自豪。”李然补充说。

18
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:35,840
In fact, learning poems can be fun for everyone.
事实上，学习诗歌对每个人来说都可以很有趣。

19
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:45,300
These activities not only offer students a chance to learn more about Chinese poems, but also bring people of different languages and cultures together.
这些活动不仅为学生提供进一步了解中国诗歌的机会，还把不同语言、不同文化的人们聚到一起。
